        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima kua lufu lua Ahaba, Bena Moaba bakatombokela Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazaya wakakuluka mu tusoso tua mabaya a madidishi a ku nsubu wandi wa kulu wa mu Samalea, wakasama; wakabikila ba-messager bandi, wakabambila ne, Yai bienu kudi Bâla-zebuba, nzambi wa mu Ekelona, numuebeshe ne, Meme nensangale ku disama edi, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi muanjelo wa Yehowa wakambila Eliya, Muena Tishebe, ne, Juka, uye kusangila ne ba-messager ba mukelenge wa Samalea, uheheshe ne, Nudi nuyila kuebesha Bâla-zebuba, nzambi wa Ekelona, bualu, bualu bua kakuena Nzambi mu Isalele, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yehowa udi wamba ne, Wewe kuena ujuka ha bulalu bûdi mulale, kadi wewe neufue bulelela. Eliya wakumukaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba-messager bandi bakahingana kudiye, yeye wakabakonka ne, Nuakuhingana bua tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamuambila ne, Muntu wakasangila nʼetu, wakatuambila ne, Alukilai, nuhingane kudi mukelenge wakanutuma, numuambile ne, Yehowa udi ukonka ne, Nudi nuyila kuebesha Bâla-zebuba, nzambi wa Ekelona, bualu, bualu bua kakuena Nzambi mu Isalele, anyi? Nunku wewe kuena ujuka ha bulalu bûdi mulale, kadi neufue bulelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabebesha ne, Muntu unuakasangila nʼandi, wakanuambila mei â, wakadi bishi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamuambila ne, Wakadi ne tshikowelu tshia miosa ne mukaba wa tshiseba ku tshifuka tshiandi. Yeye wakamba ne, Yeye udi Eliya, Muena Tishebe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mukelenge wakamutumina kapitene ka masalayi ne bantu bandi makumi atanu. Kakaya kudiye, kakamusangana mushikame ha mutu ha mukuna. Kakamuambila ne, Wewe, muntu wa Nzambi, mukelenge udi wamba ne, Uhueke biebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya wakambila kapitene ka bantu bandi makumi atanu ne, Bingikala muntu wa Nzambi, kahia kafume mu diulu, kakuoshe ne bantu makumi atanu badi nʼebe. Kahia kakafuma mu diulu kakamuosha ne bantu bandi makumi atanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakatuma kapitene kakuabo ne bantu bandi makumi atanu kudiye kabidi. Kakamuambila ne, Wewe, muntu wa Nzambi, mukelenge udi wamba ne, Uhueke biebe lubilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya wakabambila ne, Bingikala muntu wa Nzambi, kahia kafuma mu diulu, kakuoshe ne bantu bebe makumi atanu. Kahia kakafuma kudi Nzambi, kakamuosha ne bantu bandi makumi atanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatuma kapitene kakuabo ne bantu bandi makumi atanu. Kapitene kisatu kakaya ne bantu bandi makumi atanu, kakatua binu biandi hanshi ku mpala kua Eliya, kakamusengelela ne, Wewe, muntu wa Nzambi, ndi nkusengelela ne, Witabushe bua muoyo wanyi ne mioyo ya bantu aba, bena mudimu bebe, makumi atanu ikale ya mushinga mukole ku mesu kuebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mona, kahia kakafuma mu diulu diambedi kakosha tupitene tubidi ne bantu batu makumi atanu makumi atanu; kadi witabushe bua muoyo wanyi wikale wa mushinga mukole ku mesu kuebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muanjelo wa Yehowa wakambila Eliya ne, Uye nʼandi, kumutshinyi. Yeye wakajuka, wakaya nʼandi kudi mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuambila ne, Yehowa udi wamba ne, Wewe wakatuma ba-messager bua kuebesha Bâla-zebuba, nzambi wa Ekelona, dî bualu bua kakuena Nzambi mu Isalele bua wewe kumuebesha dî, anyi? Nunku wewe kuena ujuka ha bulalu bûdi mulale, kadi neufue bulelela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku mukelenge wakafua bu mu dî dia Yehowa diakamba Eliya. Yeholama wakabanga kukokesha mu muaba wandi mu tshidimu tshibidi tshia bukelenge bua Yeholama, muana wa Yehoshafata, mukelenge wa Yuda, bualu bua yeye kakadi ne muana wa balume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bienzedi bia Ahazaya bikuabo biakenzeye kabiena bifunda mu mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu a bakelenge ba Isalele, anyi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
